{
  "rulesets": [
    {
      "ruleset_version": "1.0",
      "ruleset_name": "CENTRAL HEATING & COOLING RULESET – HYDRONIC BOILER + NO CENTRAL COOLING",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "block_id": "central_cooling_existing",
          "block_ref": "{Central Cooling Systems block}",
          "target_block": "cooling",
          "rules": [
            {
              "rule_id": "no_central_cooling_intro",
              "if": {
                "all": [
                  {
                    "field": "answers.cooling_central_system_present",
                    "op": "is_false"
                  },
                  {
                    "field": "answers.suite_cooling_type",
                    "op": "ne",
                    "value": "window_and_portable_ac"
                  }
                ]
              },
              "then": {
                "paragraphs": [
                  "The building is not equipped with a centralized cooling system such as a chiller or water-source heat pump."
                ]
              },
              "role": "system_header",
              "exclusive_group": "cooling_no_central_header",
              "priority": 10
            },
            {
              "rule_id": "suite_window_portable_ac_summary",
              "if": {
                "all": [
                  {
                    "field": "answers.suite_cooling_type",
                    "op": "eq",
                    "value": "window_and_portable_ac"
                  }
                ]
              },
              "then": {
                "paragraphs": [
                  "The building is not equipped with a centralized cooling system such as a chiller or water-source heat pump. Cooling within individual suites is provided by a combination of window-mounted air conditioners and portable indoor air-conditioning units.",
                  "These decentralized cooling devices are generally less efficient than modern centralized or heat-pump-based systems. Typical window and portable air-conditioning units operate with relatively low coefficients of performance (COP), often below 3.0, compared to high-efficiency heat pump systems which can achieve COP values exceeding 4.5–5.0 under favorable conditions.",
                  "In addition to reduced cooling efficiency, window-mounted air-conditioning units can negatively impact building envelope performance. Improper sealing around window installations may allow uncontrolled air infiltration during the heating season, increasing heat loss, draft complaints, and overall space-heating energy consumption. Installation of a centralized air-source heat pump (ASHP) system could be considered in a short term to mid term."
                ]
              },
              "role": "equipment_detail"
            }
          ],
          "target_section": "cooling"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ruleset_version": "1.0",
      "ruleset_name": "CENTRAL HEATING & COOLING RULESET – WSHP LOOP WITH ATMOSPHERIC BOILERS",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "block_id": "central_cooling_existing",
          "block_ref": "{Central Cooling Systems block}",
          "target_block": "cooling",
          "rules": [
            {
              "rule_id": "cooling_wshp_intro",
              "if": {
                "all": [
                  {
                    "field": "answers.cooling_system_type",
                    "op": "in",
                    "value": [
                      "wshp_cooling",
                      "fluid_cooler"
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              },
              "then": {
                "paragraphs": [
                  "Cooling for the building is provided through a water-source heat pump (WSHP) system operating on a low-temperature hydronic loop."
                ]
              },
              "role": "system_header",
              "exclusive_group": "cooling_wshp_header",
              "priority": 20
            },
            {
              "rule_id": "fluid_cooler_heat_rejection",
              "if": {
                "all": [
                  {
                    "field": "answers.fluid_cooler_present",
                    "op": "is_true"
                  },
                  {
                    "field": "answers.cooling_system_type",
                    "op": "in",
                    "value": [
                      "wshp_cooling",
                      "fluid_cooler"
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              },
              "then": {
                "paragraphs": [
                  "Heat extracted from suites is transferred into the loop and rejected outdoors through a fluid cooler during the cooling season."
                ]
              },
              "role": "equipment_detail"
            },
            {
              "rule_id": "fluid_cooler_seasonal_shutdown",
              "if": {
                "all": [
                  {
                    "field": "answers.site_visit_season",
                    "op": "eq",
                    "value": "heating_season"
                  },
                  {
                    "field": "answers.cooling_system_type",
                    "op": "in",
                    "value": [
                      "wshp_cooling",
                      "fluid_cooler"
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              },
              "then": {
                "paragraphs": [
                  "At the time of the site visit, the fluid cooler was seasonally shut down, which is typical for this type of system."
                ]
              },
              "role": "performance"
            },
            {
              "rule_id": "wshp_install_year",
              "if": {
                "all": [
                  {
                    "field": "answers.wshp_install_year",
                    "op": "exists"
                  },
                  {
                    "field": "answers.cooling_system_type",
                    "op": "in",
                    "value": [
                      "wshp_cooling",
                      "fluid_cooler"
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              },
              "then": {
                "paragraphs": [
                  "On-site staff reported that the WSHP system was installed in {wshp_install_year}."
                ]
              },
              "role": "equipment_detail"
            },
            {
              "rule_id": "wshp_equipment_condition_good",
              "if": {
                "all": [
                  {
                    "field": "answers.wshp_deficiencies_reported",
                    "op": "is_false"
                  },
                  {
                    "field": "answers.cooling_system_type",
                    "op": "in",
                    "value": [
                      "wshp_cooling",
                      "fluid_cooler"
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              },
              "then": {
                "paragraphs": [
                  "The WSHP equipment, fluid cooler, and associated hydronic loop were observed to be in generally good mechanical condition."
                ]
              },
              "role": "condition"
            },
            {
              "rule_id": "no_wshp_deficiencies",
              "if": {
                "all": [
                  {
                    "field": "answers.wshp_deficiencies_reported",
                    "op": "is_false"
                  },
                  {
                    "field": "answers.cooling_system_type",
                    "op": "in",
                    "value": [
                      "wshp_cooling",
                      "fluid_cooler"
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              },
              "then": {
                "paragraphs": [
                  "No visible leakage or vibration issues were observed during the walkthrough."
                ]
              },
              "role": "condition"
            },
            {
              "rule_id": "wshp_performance_reliable",
              "if": {
                "all": [
                  {
                    "field": "answers.wshp_deficiencies_reported",
                    "op": "is_false"
                  },
                  {
                    "field": "answers.cooling_system_type",
                    "op": "in",
                    "value": [
                      "wshp_cooling",
                      "fluid_cooler"
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              },
              "then": {
                "paragraphs": [
                  "No major mechanical deficiencies or performance issues were reported by on-site staff at the time of the site visit."
                ]
              },
              "role": "performance"
            }
          ],
          "target_section": "cooling"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ruleset_version": "1.0",
      "ruleset_name": "CENTRAL HEATING & COOLING RULESET – HYDRONIC BOILERS + FAN COIL + CHILLER",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "block_id": "central_cooling_existing",
          "block_ref": "{Central Cooling Systems block}",
          "target_block": "cooling",
          "rules": [
            {
              "rule_id": "cooling_central_chiller_intro",
              "if": {
                "all": [
                  {
                    "field": "answers.cooling_system_type",
                    "op": "eq",
                    "value": "chiller_cooling_tower"
                  }
                ]
              },
              "then": {
                "paragraphs": [
                  "Cooling is provided by a central water-cooled chiller located in the main mechanical room."
                ]
              },
              "role": "system_header",
              "exclusive_group": "cooling_chiller_tower_header",
              "priority": 30
            },
            {
              "rule_id": "cooling_chiller_install_year",
              "if": {
                "all": [
                  {
                    "field": "answers.chiller_install_year",
                    "op": "exists"
                  },
                  {
                    "field": "answers.cooling_system_type",
                    "op": "in",
                    "value": [
                      "chiller_cooling_tower",
                      "chiller_water"
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              },
              "then": {
                "paragraphs": [
                  "Chiller installation is dated to {chiller_install_year}."
                ]
              },
              "role": "equipment_detail"
            },
            {
              "rule_id": "cooling_tower_present",
              "if": {
                "all": [
                  {
                    "field": "answers.cooling_tower_present",
                    "op": "is_true"
                  },
                  {
                    "field": "answers.cooling_system_type",
                    "op": "in",
                    "value": [
                      "chiller_cooling_tower",
                      "chiller_water"
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              },
              "then": {
                "paragraphs": [
                  "Heat rejection is provided via a roof-mounted cooling tower."
                ]
              },
              "role": "equipment_detail"
            },
            {
              "rule_id": "cooling_tower_no_vfd",
              "if": {
                "all": [
                  {
                    "field": "answers.cooling_tower_present",
                    "op": "is_true"
                  },
                  {
                    "field": "answers.cooling_tower_has_vfd",
                    "op": "is_false"
                  },
                  {
                    "field": "answers.cooling_system_type",
                    "op": "in",
                    "value": [
                      "chiller_cooling_tower",
                      "chiller_water"
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              },
              "then": {
                "paragraphs": [
                  "The cooling tower fan is not equipped with variable frequency drives (VFDs)."
                ]
              },
              "role": "finding"
            },
            {
              "rule_id": "cooling_distribution_condition_ok",
              "if": {
                "all": [
                  {
                    "field": "answers.chilled_water_distribution_condition",
                    "op": "eq",
                    "value": "serviceable"
                  },
                  {
                    "field": "answers.cooling_system_type",
                    "op": "in",
                    "value": [
                      "chiller_cooling_tower",
                      "chiller_water"
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              },
              "then": {
                "paragraphs": [
                  "The chilled-water distribution system appears to be functioning normally.",
                  "Supply and return piping, pumps, and control valves were observed to be in serviceable condition."
                ]
              },
              "role": "condition"
            },
            {
              "rule_id": "cooling_fancoil_distribution",
              "if": {
                "all": [
                  {
                    "field": "answers.cooling_distribution",
                    "op": "eq",
                    "value": "fan_coil"
                  },
                  {
                    "field": "answers.cooling_system_type",
                    "op": "in",
                    "value": [
                      "chiller_cooling_tower",
                      "chiller_water"
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              },
              "then": {
                "paragraphs": [
                  "Suite-level cooling is provided by in-suite fan coil units operating under local thermostatic control."
                ]
              },
              "role": "loads"
            },
            {
              "rule_id": "cooling_seasonal_shutdown",
              "if": {
                "all": [
                  {
                    "field": "answers.site_visit_season",
                    "op": "eq",
                    "value": "heating_season"
                  },
                  {
                    "field": "answers.cooling_system_type",
                    "op": "in",
                    "value": [
                      "chiller_cooling_tower",
                      "chiller_water"
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              },
              "then": {
                "paragraphs": [
                  "At the time of the site visit, the chiller and cooling tower were seasonally shut down.",
                  "This is typical for the time of year."
                ]
              },
              "role": "performance"
            },
            {
              "rule_id": "cooling_no_physical_deficiencies",
              "if": {
                "all": [
                  {
                    "field": "answers.cooling_issues_reported",
                    "op": "is_false"
                  },
                  {
                    "field": "answers.cooling_system_type",
                    "op": "eq",
                    "value": "chiller_cooling_tower"
                  }
                ]
              },
              "then": {
                "paragraphs": [
                  "No major physical deficiencies were identified during the walkthrough."
                ]
              },
              "role": "condition"
            },
            {
              "rule_id": "cooling_reliable_operation",
              "if": {
                "all": [
                  {
                    "field": "answers.cooling_issues_reported",
                    "op": "is_false"
                  },
                  {
                    "field": "answers.cooling_system_type",
                    "op": "eq",
                    "value": "chiller_cooling_tower"
                  }
                ]
              },
              "then": {
                "paragraphs": [
                  "Building staff reported generally reliable operation during the most recent cooling season."
                ]
              },
              "role": "performance"
            }
          ],
          "target_section": "cooling"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ruleset_version": "1.0",
      "ruleset_name": "CENTRAL HEATING & COOLING RULESET – WATER-COOLED CHILLER",
